<title>POLAND: Polish net reserves rise to $21.87 bln in Nov 1-20.</title>
<headline>Polish net reserves rise to $21.87 bln in Nov 1-20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish net foreign currency reserves grew by $424.1 million in November to $21.87 billion and were $1.43-billion higher than at the start of the year, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
</text>
